# AVD-KSV-0056: deploy/deployment's default RBAC intentionally grants
# create/update/delete on services/ingresses - this chart's ServiceAccount
# installs arbitrary charts on a caller's behalf, and those charts create
# exactly these resource kinds (see test/hello-world). Narrowing the
# shipped default wouldn't fix anything; deploy/deployment/README.md's
# Security section already tells operators to scope rbac.rules to what
# they actually intend to serve, which is the real fix. See README.md's
# Code quality section for the full reasoning.
AVD-KSV-0056
